# Standing tall at 14.5 m/s on the 10% section, over wobble.speed (12 m/s): the trucks start to
# shimmy, the wobble grows and throws the rider off within a few seconds ("speed wobbles").
# lab-hill-wobble-tuck rides the same start crouched and never wobbles.
park lab
spawn lab_hill_ten
cmd 6 speed 14.5
run 700
expect max skater.wobble > 0.5
expect event bail{reason=speed wobbles} within 150..600
expect event danger{why=speed wobbles} within 150..200
